  "notes": "{診|み}る means to examine medically, different from ⟦{見|み}る→見る：00283_miru⟧ (to see/look).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧)\n- Conjugation: Ichidan (⟦{一段|いちだん}→一段：08951_ichidan⟧)\n- Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{診|み}る (to examine X)\n\nKANJI DISTINCTION:\n- {診|み}る: to examine (medically)\n- ⟦{見|み}る→見る：00283_miru⟧: to see, to look at\n- {看|み}る: to look after, to take care of\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{医者|いしゃ}→医者：02847_isha⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{診|み}て⟦もらう→もらう：00520_morau⟧ (to be seen by a doctor)\n- ⟦{患者|かんじゃ}→患者：00170_kanja⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{診|み}る (to examine a patient)\n- ⟦{病気|びょうき}→病気：00771_byouki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{診|み}る (to diagnose an illness)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{診察|しんさつ}→診察：03259_shinsatsu⟧: medical examination\n- ⟦{診断|しんだん}→診断：04209_shindan⟧: diagnosis\n- ⟦{診療|しんりょう}→診療：14183_shinryou⟧: medical treatment",
